<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Engil boosts profit 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Engil boosts profit 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending Dec 31</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		1.507	vs     1.179</p>
<p>    Turnover		 62.10	 up 22.4 percent</p>
<p>    Cashflow		  4.76	 up 23.2 percent</p>
<p>Return on equity  12.70 percent  (no comparison given)</p>
<p>    Return on assets   7.62	    (no comparison given)</p>
<p>Note - Engil SGPS is a construction company.</p>
</text>
